---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import RoutingDemo from '../components/RoutingDemo';
import '../styles/public.css';
---
<BaseLayout title="A considered route for every agent request">
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-copy"><a class="announcement" href="/pricing"><span class="status-dot"></span> A new direction for agent calls <span>↗</span></a><h1>Every request.<br />A better <span class="route-word">route<svg viewBox="0 0 235 12" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 9C60 1 155 1 232 7" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"/></svg></span>.</h1><p class="hero-description">Let your agent do the work.<br />Let Zusal choose the model.</p><p class="hero-secondary">Thoughtful model selection for your existing coding agent. Your provider accounts. A clearer view of every call.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a href="/download" class="button primary">Get Zusal <span>↗</span></a><a href="/app/demo" class="quiet-link">Explore the dashboard <span>→</span></a></div><span class="hero-caption">YOUR HARNESS. YOUR MODELS. ONE ROUTER.</span></div>
    <div class="hero-visual"><RoutingDemo client:load /><span class="visual-caption"><span>LESS MANUAL SWITCHING</span><span>MORE ROOM TO BUILD</span></span></div>
  </section>
  <div class="compatibility-strip"><span class="eyebrow">Made to fit your workflow</span><div><span class="harness-name">π <strong>Pi</strong></span><span class="divider">/</span><span class="harness-name">↗ <strong>DeepSeek Harness</strong><small>integration planned</small></span></div><a href="/docs#compatibility">View release readiness ↗</a></div>
  <section class="editorial-section introduction"><div class="section-index">01 / THE IDEA</div><div><h2>One model shouldn’t<br />have to do everything.</h2><div class="intro-columns"><p>A small edit. A tricky bug. A fresh architecture. Different requests ask different things of a model.</p><p>Zusal assesses each turn and chooses from your eligible models. Your harness keeps the context, tools, and execution. You stay focused on the work.</p></div><a href="/docs#how-it-works" class="text-link">See how routing works ↗</a></div></section>
  <section class="workflow-section"><div class="section-heading"><span class="eyebrow">02 / A SMALL ADDITION TO YOUR STACK</span><h2>Keep your workflow.<br />Change the route.</h2></div><div class="workflow-list"><article><span class="step-number">01</span><div><h3>Connect your agent.</h3><p>Add Zusal to a supported harness. Keep your existing provider credentials where they belong.</p></div><span class="step-glyph">↳</span></article><article><span class="step-number">02</span><div><h3>Give every turn a little thought.</h3><p>Jev assesses the request. Zusal selects an eligible model; the harness makes the call.</p></div><span class="step-glyph">⇢</span></article><article><span class="step-number">03</span><div><h3>Know what happened.</h3><p>See models, tokens, and estimated costs. Request-level reporting without storing your prompts or code.</p></div><span class="step-glyph">↗</span></article></div></section>
  <section class="visibility-section"><div class="visibility-copy"><span class="eyebrow">03 / NOTHING LOST IN THE ROUTE</span><h2>A clear view.<br />Call by call.</h2><p>Your agent can make dozens of calls in a session. Bring them into focus with a quiet, useful dashboard.</p><ul class="feature-checks"><li>Models, tokens, and estimated provider costs</li><li>30 days of request details, 12 months of daily totals</li><li>CSV exports. No prompts or responses in history.</li></ul><a href="/app/demo" class="text-link">Take a look around ↗</a></div><div class="dashboard-preview"><div class="preview-top"><span><span class="status-dot"></span> WORKSPACE OVERVIEW</span><span>ILLUSTRATIVE DATA</span></div><div class="preview-metrics"><div><span>Model requests</span><strong>128</strong></div><div><span>Tokens</span><strong>42.6k</strong></div><div><span>Models used</span><strong>3</strong></div></div><div class="preview-chart" role="img" aria-label="Illustrative request activity across a week">{[25,45,34,70,48,92,65,42,80,100,72,58,90,66,85,60,48,72,93,70,78,56,96,80].map((n)=><span style={`--bar-height:${n}%`}></span>)}</div><div class="chart-axis"><span>MON</span><span>WED</span><span>FRI</span><span>SUN</span></div><div class="preview-row"><span><i></i> Efficient tier</span><span>Documentation</span><span>Completed ↗</span></div><div class="preview-row"><span><i></i> Frontier tier</span><span>Debugging</span><span>Completed ↗</span></div><p class="preview-disclaimer">Example data only. Your usage appears after connection.</p></div></section>
  <section class="principles-strip"><div><span class="eyebrow">YOUR PROVIDER ACCESS</span><p>Keep the accounts<br />you already use.</p></div><div><span class="eyebrow">A CLEAR BOUNDARY</span><p>We route.<br />Your harness executes.</p></div><div><span class="eyebrow">DELIBERATE DATA</span><p>Usage metadata.<br />Not your source code.</p></div></section>
  <section class="closing-section"><div><span class="eyebrow">A BETTER ROUTE STARTS HERE</span><h2>More building.<br />Less model switching.</h2><p>Pro is $5/month or $50/year. Model-provider usage is billed separately.</p></div><div><a href="/download" class="button primary">Get started with Zusal ↗</a><a class="quiet-link" href="/pricing">Explore Pro →</a></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
